  description: "3Der Maze 1.0\nYou are in a maze of twisty passages, all alike. Exits
    are to the north, south, east, west, top, and bottom.\n\nNavigate a 3D maze which
    the defuser sees in a first-person perspective. Identify the correct maze by finding
    floating letters.\n\nModule ID: 3DerMaze\n\nArrow textures taken from Spare Wizard's
    3D Maze\nButton texture taken from Vanilla Keypad\nOther texures & all models
    by MykiiVT\n\nManual available here:\n\nPlease let me know about any bugs on discord
    at mykiivt :)\r\n---\r\nBuild 1.0 notes:\r\n- Initial release"
